	(gr_text_box "If using a PICO9918A only U2, U1, J3, J2, J1, and C1-C8 should be populated.\nIf using a single TMS9918A, all components should be populated (Q3 Opt.).\nPLD Logic is device specific/\n(see documentation for expr. dual TMS config)"
		(start 97.253208 70.147205)
