	(gr_text_box "Exprimental Dual TMS Config:\nJ7 - BC=ON, FC=OFF\nJ10,11 - ON on both cards\nBC J9, P1 to FC J9, P4\nBC J9, P5-7 to FC J9, P5-7\nBC DNP Y1, C9,C10\nDisplay to FC Comp_Monitor\n*BC=backcard, FC=frontcard\n(see documentation)"
